	(text "OPTION: GY-PCM5102 module (J10) INSTEAD OF the on-board DAC.\nFit EITHER U9 + C12-C20 + FB3 + R7/R8 OR the module - never both (two DAC outputs would fight).\nThe module has its own 470R/2.2nF output filter. Module solder jumpers: H1=L H2=L H3=H H4=L."
